#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:5 869ef43ff884450da6ad809153f14b17
msgid "Arming / Disarming"
msgstr "解锁 / 上锁"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:7 43dfc30ba8d94b4c80c4a5513cc78acb
msgid ""
"Before the rover's motors will move it must be armed.  Arming is required"
" for two reasons:"
msgstr "在车辆电机运转之前，必须先进行解锁。解锁有两个原因："

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:9 f1e713103d324348b04b9fd0b87ce06b
msgid "to prevent the motors from turning when the user is not ready to drive"
msgstr "防止用户尚未准备好驾驶时电机意外转动"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:10 0f6313e59c46405799379e2b600d44c4
msgid "prevent movement before the autopilot is fully configured and ready to go"
msgstr "在飞控完全配置并就绪之前防止车辆移动"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:13 fff79143f7ec452f9d1fcfc41700de45
msgid "How to Arm"
msgstr "如何解锁"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:15 43edab87ed6a4282ab861747b4fe1437
msgid ""
"Before arming you should normally wait for the LED on the autopilot to "
"become flashing blue (if you only intend to use :ref:`Manual <manual-"
"mode>`) or flashing green (for all other modes). If the LEDs never become"
" blue or green please see the \"Pre-Arm Checks\" section below."
msgstr ""
"解锁前，通常应等待飞控上的 LED 变为蓝色闪烁（若仅使用 :ref:`Manual <manual-mode>` "
"模式）或绿色闪烁（适用于其他所有模式）。若 LED 始终未变为蓝色或绿色，请参阅下方「解锁前检查」章节。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:19 bd1673b9add54802b05c0489119e341a
msgid "There are three ways to arm the vehicle:"
msgstr "有三种方式可以解锁车辆："

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:21 6694278d14d0409d968c54595429ab28
msgid ""
"**From the transmitter sticks**.  Ensure the vehicle is in :ref:`Hold "
"<hold-mode>`, :ref:`Manual <manual-mode>`, :ref:`Acro <acro-mode>` or "
":ref:`Steering <steering-mode>` mode, then center the throttle stick and "
"hold the steering stick fully to the right for 2 seconds"
msgstr ""
"**通过遥控器摇杆**。确保车辆处于 :ref:`Hold <hold-mode>`、:ref:`Manual <manual-"
"mode>`、:ref:`Acro <acro-mode>` 或 :ref:`Steering <steering-mode>` "
"模式，将油门摇杆置于中位，然后将转向摇杆向右完全推到底并保持 2 秒"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:22 7778012ab31f48eb8b5e93b994cdff9b
msgid ""
"**From a transmitter switch**.  If setup, you can use one of the "
"**RCx_OPTION switches** that includes the arm function. See switch option"
" \"153\", \"154, or \"160."
msgstr "**通过遥控器开关**。若已配置，可使用包含解锁功能的 **RCx_OPTION 开关**。参见开关选项 「153」、「154」或「160」。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:23
#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:38 0d4aee0d592b4e3fa37ba5e105345589
#: 7d93cf38bf2446fe8390d6e8a682ea5d
msgid ""
"**From the Ground Station**.  Press the arm/disarm button on your ground "
"station.  If using the Mission Planner this can be found on the Flight "
"Data screen's action tab on the bottom left"
msgstr "**通过地面站**。在地面站上按下解锁/上锁按钮。若使用 Mission Planner，该按钮位于飞行数据界面左下方的操作选项卡中"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:27 c9fac859b1774754947bdce4ce4b5274
msgid ""
"If the vehicle fails to arm, please see the \"Pre-Arm Checks\" section "
"below."
msgstr "若车辆无法解锁，请参阅下方「解锁前检查」章节。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:29 a3cc3c5bc8f14d9c83a6e3e85eff583b
msgid ""
"Rover cannot be armed in RTL or SMARTRTL modes. In addition AUTO, GUIDED,"
" LOITER, RTL, SMARTRTL, FOLLOW, and DOCK modes cannot be armed via an "
":ref:`common-auxiliary-functions` RC switch."
msgstr ""
"Rover 不能在 RTL 或 SmartRTL 模式下解锁。此外，AUTO、Guided、Loiter、RTL、SmartRTL、FOLLOW "
"和 DOCK 模式不能通过 :ref:`common-auxiliary-functions` RC 开关解锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:31 bc7c7b41f0df42939e9fb63d31dc24d7
msgid ""
"Rover will allow arming in some modes without a good GPS location being "
"obtained before arming. If you want any of the modes such as RTL, LOITER,"
" etc. to work properly, you should enable the \"Need location\" pre-arm "
"check by setting the :ref:`ARMING_NEED_LOC<ARMING_NEED_LOC>` parameter to"
" \"1\" to be sure you have position information available."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:34 b49b59af54564227bb9cb8534a643ece
msgid "How to Disarm"
msgstr "如何上锁"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:36 8f186200b12d46979dd922c27e50fdb8
msgid ""
"**From the transmitter sticks**.  Ensure the vehicle is in :ref:`Hold "
"<hold-mode>`, :ref:`Manual <manual-mode>`, :ref:`Acro <acro-mode>` or "
":ref:`Steering <steering-mode>` mode, then hold the steering stick fully "
"left for 2 seconds"
msgstr ""
"**通过遥控器摇杆**。确保车辆处于 :ref:`Hold <hold-mode>`、:ref:`Manual <manual-"
"mode>`、:ref:`Acro <acro-mode>` 或 :ref:`Steering <steering-mode>` "
"模式，然后将转向摇杆向左完全推到底并保持 2 秒"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:37 30576fd6722e4300968cb36521793967
msgid ""
"**From a transmitter switch**.  If setup, you can use one of the "
"``RCx_OPTION`` switches that includes the disarm function. See switch "
"option \"81\", \"153, or \"154\"."
msgstr "**通过遥控器开关**。若已配置，可使用包含上锁功能的 ``RCx_OPTION`` 开关。参见开关选项「81」、「153」或「154」。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:42 06a1b7547587427495a05095f3fcd4a3
msgid ""
"Skid-steering vehicles can only be disarmed from the transmitter in "
":ref:`Hold <hold-mode>` mode because otherwise they would turn around and"
" around in circles whilst the pilot was trying to disarm"
msgstr "差速转向车辆只能在遥控器处于 :ref:`Hold <hold-mode>` 模式时通过遥控器上锁，否则在操作者尝试上锁时车辆会不停地原地打转"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:46 246b19c7b99e477e96bbcac146a2ce7e
msgid "Pre-Arm Checks"
msgstr "解锁前检查"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:48 654591e7cee94503bbdc9f20c7dc70ad
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Rover includes a suite of safety checks which prevent the vehicle from "
"arming if any of a fairly large number of issues are discovered including"
" missed calibration, configuration or bad sensor data.  These checks help"
" prevent sudden motor startups and drive-aways but they can also be "
"disabled by setting the :ref:`ARMING_SKIPCHK <ARMING_SKIPCHK>` parameter "
"if necessary."
msgstr ""
"Rover "
"包含一套安全检查机制，若发现相当多的问题（包括未完成校准、配置错误或传感器数据异常），将阻止车辆解锁。这些检查有助于防止电机突然启动和车辆失控驶离，但如有必要，也可通过设置"
" :ref:`ARMING_CHECK <ARMING_CHECK>` 参数来禁用这些检查。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:54 fed6523ed6314022836b830016c583a8
msgid ""
"The reason for the failure can be seen by connecting the autopilot to a "
"ground station (using telemetry or a USB cable), after attempting to arm "
"the reason should be displayed on the HUD in red letters."
msgstr "可通过将飞控连接到地面站（使用数传或 USB 线缆）查看失败原因，尝试解锁后失败原因应以红色文字显示在 HUD 上。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:58 aef3af90368e47e1b13b659340bd34ac
msgid ""
"A more complete list of failures can be found on the :ref:`Pre-Arm Safety"
" Checks<common-prearm-safety-checks>` but some common of the Rover "
"specific checks are listed below:"
msgstr ""
"更完整的失败列表可在 :ref:`解锁前安全检查 <common-prearm-safety-checks>` 中找到，以下列出了一些 Rover"
" 特有的常见检查项目："

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:60 8ca12073d69d4cbba72c8f0d0a53a0e3
msgid ""
"Safety switch. The safety switch must be set to the off state before "
"arming is allowed. This is either done by pressing the safety switch for "
"2 seconds until it stops flashing, or you can disable the use of the "
"safety switch by setting :ref:`BRD_SAFETY_DEFLT <BRD_SAFETY_DEFLT>` to 0."
msgstr ""
"安全开关。解锁前必须将安全开关置于关闭状态。可按住安全开关 2 秒直至其停止闪烁，或将 :ref:`BRD_SAFETY_DEFLT "
"<BRD_SAFETY_DEFLT>` 设置为 0 来禁用安全开关。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:64 8e86bebd5c6042dba260e7fa35130cb9
msgid ""
"Inertial Sensor Checks. The accelerometers and gyroscopes must all be "
"healthy and all be calibrated. If you have more than one accel or gyro "
"then they need to be consistent with each other."
msgstr "惯性传感器检查。所有加速度计和陀螺仪必须正常工作且完成校准。若存在多个加速度计或陀螺仪，它们之间的数据需相互一致。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:67 b05a3c7047ce4848a41f8fef956bf0c1
msgid ""
"AHRS checks. The AHRS (attitude heading reference system) needs to be "
"initialized and ready. This normally takes at least 30 seconds after "
"boot."
msgstr "AHRS 检查。AHRS（姿态航向参考系统）需要完成初始化并就绪。这通常在启动后至少需要 30 秒。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:69 81be8afa7bb4458da842a2ed714b9f8e
msgid ""
"Compass checks. All compasses must be configured and calibrated, and need"
" to be consistent with each other (if you have more than one compass)"
msgstr "罗盘检查。所有罗盘必须已配置并完成校准，且数据之间需相互一致（若存在多个罗盘）"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:71 0f2e177a82a84a9ba234296e2b7e5f0b
msgid ""
"GPS Checks. You need to have a 3D GPS fix for most modes. **GPS n has not"
" been fully configured** is displayed when the GPS driver is unable to "
"fully configure the GPS. This can be caused by a bad wire between the "
"autopilot and GPS, or by a bad response from the GPS."
msgstr ""
"GPS 检查。大多数模式需要获得 3D GPS 定位。当 GPS 驱动无法完全配置 GPS 时，将显示 **GPS n "
"尚未完全配置**。这可能是由飞控与 GPS 之间的线路不良或 GPS 响应异常引起的。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:75 3a02858dfe9c40a6b36065e7718ae064
msgid ""
"Battery checks. The battery voltage must be above the failsafe voltage "
"(if configured)"
msgstr "电池检查。电池电压必须高于失控保护电压（若已配置）"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:77 fe42fd796d7b4715ae1a2169d24382d6
msgid ""
"Logging checks. The logging subsystem needs to be working (ie. a microSD "
"must be fitted and working)"
msgstr "日志检查。日志子系统必须正常运行（即必须安装并正常工作的 microSD 卡）"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:79 c4511cbf6aa04fafb5ce069e80d31909
msgid ""
"RC Control checks. The RC input must have be calibrated and not in "
"failsafe (i.e. transmitter switched on)."
msgstr "遥控器控制检查。RC 输入必须已完成校准且不处于失控保护状态（即发射机已开启）。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:81 c2948a61f35c4d29985c38baf3e9165b
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The pre-arm checks can be partially or completely disabled by setting the"
" :ref:`ARMING_SKIPCHK <ARMING_SKIPCHK>` parameter.  The default of 0 "
"means all checks are enabled.  In extremely unusual circumstances, "
"setting the parameter to -1 can be used to skip all current and future "
"pre-arm checks (though mandatory checks still remain)."
msgstr ""
"可通过设置 :ref:`ARMING_CHECK <ARMING_CHECK>` 参数来部分或完全禁用解锁前检查。默认值 1 "
"表示启用所有检查；若设置为 0，则禁用所有检查。包括 Mission Planner 在内的地面站也允许单独禁用某些检查项目。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:85 867be89d35f241ab96be39603785eed3
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In general the cause of a failure should be addressed and the "
":ref:`ARMING_SKIPCHK <ARMING_SKIPCHK>` parameter should be reset back to "
"0."
msgstr "通常应查明并解决故障原因，并将 :ref:`ARMING_CHECK <ARMING_CHECK>` 参数重置回 1。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:90 527eaafd92cf448494a329fd44ee218e
msgid ""
"If you are arming from the transmitter and no failure message is being "
"displayed on the HUD then it may be that the RC calibration is off so the"
" autopilot is not seeing the throttle at middle or steering at the full "
"right position.  Try re-doing the :ref:`RC calibration <common-radio-"
"control-calibration>`."
msgstr ""
"若通过遥控器解锁但 HUD 上未显示任何失败消息，则可能是 RC 校准有误，导致飞控无法检测到油门位于中位或转向摇杆在最右侧。请尝试重新执行 "
":ref:`RC 校准 <common-radio-control-calibration>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:95 6df16435e24943da84fdc7fac906ef7c
msgid "Disabling Arming/Disarming"
msgstr "禁用解锁/上锁"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:97 f5c08e9ae5b84786a261849b13f4b620
msgid ""
"Although it is not recommended, it is possible to disable the requirement"
" to arm the vehicle by setting the :ref:`ARMING_REQUIRE <ARMING_REQUIRE>`"
" parameter to zero. The vehicle will effectively be armed immediately at "
"startup but please note that modes requiring GPS (all modes except "
":ref:`Hold <hold-mode>` and :ref:`Manual <manual-mode>`) will not operate"
" until after a good GPS lock (or more accurately a good EKF position "
"estimate) is achieved."
msgstr ""
"虽然不推荐，但可以通过将 :ref:`ARMING_REQUIRE <ARMING_REQUIRE>` "
"参数设置为零来禁用解锁要求。车辆将在启动后立即进入有效的解锁状态，但请注意，需要 GPS 的模式（除 :ref:`Hold <hold-"
"mode>` 和 :ref:`Manual <manual-mode>` 之外的所有模式）在获得良好 GPS 锁定（或更准确地说是良好的 EKF "
"位置估计）之前将无法运行。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:103 9de9b2a8342540818f688f833045ba16
msgid ""
"setting the :ref:`ARMING_REQUIRE <ARMING_REQUIRE>` parameter to zero is "
"NOT recommended. If you desire to automatically arm. set it to \"3\" to "
"arm automatically once pre-arm checks are satisfied the first time after "
"booting."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:106 a4b7c75382f74b6c90f15dd5be761814
msgid "LED and Buzzer"
msgstr "LED 与蜂鸣器"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:108 08678df160134a81aa57e6e38f7e44d0
msgid "The LED and buzzer provide visual and audio clues as to the arming state:"
msgstr "LED 和蜂鸣器提供解锁状态的视觉与听觉提示："

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:110 dfd01ca77e2c44c0839e4ee89ac2c39e
msgid ""
"LED flashing blue - vehicle is disarmed but is ready-to-arm in "
":ref:`Manual <manual-mode>`"
msgstr "LED 蓝色闪烁——车辆已上锁，但在 :ref:`Manual <manual-mode>` 模式下已准备好解锁"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:111 7978b8ce64e84dad8d4d64d81e9e76a3
msgid ""
"LED flashing green - vehicle is disarmed but ready-to-arm in all modes "
"(vehicle has a good position estimate)"
msgstr "LED 绿色闪烁——车辆已上锁，但在所有模式下均已准备好解锁（车辆具有良好的位置估计）"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:112 9ca21d10f0244c02a5e1a3bc90318eb6
msgid ""
"LED flashing yellow - vehicle cannot be armed because one of the pre-arm "
"checks is failing"
msgstr "LED 黄色闪烁——车辆无法解锁，因为某项解锁前检查未通过"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:113 b78fa2cbfbf34c95ad41b23cbb91de04
msgid ""
"when the autopilot is ready to arm it will play a \"ready to arm\" sound "
"on the buzzer"
msgstr "当飞控准备好解锁时，蜂鸣器会播放「准备解锁」的声音"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:115 88cb699a06c747709b8073b3a17343c3
msgid "during arming the buzzer will play a 2 second long warning buzzer"
msgstr "解锁过程中蜂鸣器会发出持续 2 秒的警告声"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:116 69b25c97e4e44858b4ccedbeab8e324a
msgid "during disarming, the buzzer will play a short warning buzz"
msgstr "上锁过程中蜂鸣器会发出短促的警告声"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:118 105906ed769240c6bb338a3a1e2215c7
msgid ""
"A full list of buzzer sounds can be found on the :ref:`sounds page "
"<common-sounds-pixhawkpx4>`."
msgstr "完整的蜂鸣器声音列表可在 :ref:`声音页面 <common-sounds-pixhawkpx4>` 中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:120 3bdbaa02d79840cea6f2921878f8e074
msgid ""
"Unless the :ref:`ARMING_OPTIONS<ARMING_OPTIONS>` bit 2 is set, text "
"messages will be sent to the GCS to indicate when arming or disarming has"
" occurred."
msgstr ""
"除非设置了 :ref:`ARMING_OPTIONS<ARMING_OPTIONS>` 的第 2 "
"位，否则在解锁或上锁时将向地面站发送文本消息以进行指示。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:123 c31a60665c3b4cc1af4211cda211ad81
msgid "PWM Output Behaviour when Disarmed"
msgstr "上锁状态下的 PWM 输出行为"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:125 0fb156e8de7249bbb5484455fd35da19
msgid ""
"The PWM value output to the servos and motors while the vehicle is "
"disarmed can be configured in one of two ways:"
msgstr "车辆上锁时向舵机和电机输出的 PWM 值可通过以下两种方式之一进行配置："

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:127 d6463217dff443ce9a22aa349a8c8166
msgid ""
"if :ref:`MOT_SAFE_DISARM <MOT_SAFE_DISARM>` is 0 (the default) the trim "
"value for each channel will be output (i.e :ref:`RC1_TRIM <RC1_TRIM>` "
"will be output on channel 1, :ref:`RC3_TRIM <RC3_TRIM>` will be output on"
" channel 3)."
msgstr ""
"若 :ref:`MOT_SAFE_DISARM <MOT_SAFE_DISARM>` 为 0（默认值），将输出每个通道的中立修调值（即通道 1 "
"输出 :ref:`RC1_TRIM <RC1_TRIM>`，通道 3 输出 :ref:`RC3_TRIM <RC3_TRIM>`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:129 b339d3099da94b96a5163806a5d8a1c2
msgid ""
"if :ref:`MOT_SAFE_DISARM <MOT_SAFE_DISARM>` is 1 no PWM pulses will be "
"sent while disarmed. Note that some ESCs beep to complain that they are "
"powered on without a control signal"
msgstr ""
"若 :ref:`MOT_SAFE_DISARM <MOT_SAFE_DISARM>` 为 1，上锁时将不发送任何 PWM "
"脉冲。注意，某些电调会在通电但没有控制信号时发出报警声"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:132 edc50bc2c766413db3eb72615bbe64fb
msgid ""
"Note that if the autopilot has a safety switch which is enabled, no PWM "
"output will be sent until the safety switch is put in the ON position."
msgstr "请注意，若飞控启用了安全开关，在安全开关置于 ON 位置之前不会发送任何 PWM 输出。"

